{
  "id": "276",
  "title": "Panda baby not used to Chinese",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-03-08",
  "synopsis": "A panda baby that returned home to China from America has still not gotten used to the Chinese language.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/360/24db405a7bc2a44fa3d394d8c13d3e827b9bab71.mp3?1488828658",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "熊猫宝宝听不惯中文\n\n    在美国的熊猫宝宝回国了。回国后的熊猫宝宝一点儿也不紧张。但是熊猫宝宝还听不惯中文，也吃不惯中国的熊猫饼干。因为熊猫宝宝在美国听的是英文，吃的是美国的熊猫饼干。",
    "traditional": "熊貓寶寶聽不慣中文\n\n    在美國的熊貓寶寶回國了。回國後的熊貓寶寶一點兒也不緊張。但是熊貓寶寶還聽不慣中文，也吃不慣中國的熊貓餅乾。因為熊貓寶寶在美國聽的是英文，吃的是美國的熊貓餅乾。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Panda baby not used to hearing Chinese"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在美国的熊猫宝宝回国了。",
      "traditional": "在美國的熊貓寶寶回國了。",
      "pinyin": "zài měi guó de xióng māo bǎo bao huí guó le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "回国后的熊猫宝宝一点儿也不紧张。",
      "traditional": "回國後的熊貓寶寶一點兒也不緊張。",
      "pinyin": "huí guó hòu de xióng māo bǎo bao yì diǎn'r yě bù jǐn zhāng",
      "english": "A panda baby that lived in America returned home to China."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "但是熊猫宝宝还听不惯中文，也吃不惯中国的熊猫饼干。",
      "traditional": "但是熊貓寶寶還聽不慣中文，也吃不慣中國的熊貓餅乾。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì xióng māo bǎo bao hái tīng bu guàn zhōng wén yě chī bu guàn zhōng guó de xióng māo bǐng gān",
      "english": "After returning home, the panda baby was not even a bit nervous."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "因为熊猫宝宝在美国听的是英文，吃的是美国的熊猫饼干。",
      "traditional": "因為熊貓寶寶在美國聽的是英文，吃的是美國的熊貓餅乾。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi xióng māo bǎo bao zài měi guó tīng de shì yīng wén chī de shì měi guó de xióng māo bǐng gān",
      "english": "But the panda baby is still not used to hearing Chinese, and is not used to eating Chinese panda biscuits."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Because in America the panda baby listened to English, and ate American panda biscuits."
    }
  ],
